      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureUsers-Description\">Description</h2><p>OpenMRS provides a mechanism to configure users (add, assign roles, modify) through the Administration screen. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://wiki.openmrs.org/display/docs/Administering+Users\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenMRS guide</a> provides details about the roles and privileges. In this page, description of adding users, assigning roles is elaborated.</p><h2 id=\"ConfigureUsers-Steps\">Steps</h2><h3 id=\"ConfigureUsers-AddNewUserandAssignRoles\">Add New User and Assign Roles</h3><ol><li>Login to OpenMRS with user having Administrator privileges.</li><li>Navigate to the OpenMRS Administration page and select &quot;Manage Users&quot; link.<br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.45.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724646752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.45.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724646752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775823\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-23 at 2.45.41 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"5c120376-d2f4-470a-9ba8-fb9f931058cb\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.45.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724646752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=738 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.45.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724646752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369 1x\"></span><br/><br/></li><li>Click on &quot;Add User&quot; link.</li><li>Under &quot;Create a new person&quot; label, click on &quot;Next&quot; button.</li><li>In the page which appears, add information about the user.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.43.37%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724867857&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=367\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.43.37%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724867857&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775824\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-23 at 2.43.37 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"f4666826-be28-49fa-beae-f5127ba59bc7\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.43.37%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724867857&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=734 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.43.37%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458724867857&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=367 1x\"></span><br/><br/></li><li>Assign required roles to the user.<br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.52.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458725015486&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.52.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458725015486&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"47775825\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-03-23 at 2.52.41 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"dc91f666-6252-4474-bc8b-38bb9a5cb0c5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.52.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458725015486&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=738 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/Screen%20Shot%202016-03-23%20at%202.52.41%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1458725015486&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=369 1x\"></span></li><li>Finally, click on &quot;Save user&quot; button to save the changes made.</li></ol><p><strong><br/></strong></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureUsers-Makingauserasaprovider(doctor/clinician/nurse)\"><strong>Making a user as a provider (doctor / clinician / nurse)<br/></strong></h2><p>Perform the following steps to add a user as a doctor/clinician/nurse in Bahmni (they are called <em>providers</em>).</p><ol><li>Click on <strong>&quot;Manage Providers&quot; </strong>in the OpenMRS administration page<h2 id=\"ConfigureUsers-\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947633260&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=358\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947633260&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"92962918\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"1.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"c1eff73a-f235-4f83-b5b1-0f80775239c1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947633260&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=716 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/1.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947633260&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=358 1x\"></span></h2><div><strong><br/></strong></div></li><li>Click on <strong>&quot;Add Provider&quot;</strong><br/><strong><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947704741&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=175\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947704741&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"92962921\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"2.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"34013682\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"ba642fd1-14fa-4e65-8ae6-825c43d756ba\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947704741&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=350 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/2.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947704741&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=175 1x\"></span><br/></strong></li><li>Enter the name of the person you want to add as provider and select it from the auto complete list and click on <strong>&quot;Save&quot;.</strong><br/><strong><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/34013682/3.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1476947808879&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=163\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/34013682/3.png?version=1&amp;modifi